{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Design a six-card information grid section for a premium olive oil brand (“AIWO Olive Aura”). The section should visually communicate scientific quality, freshness, and craftsmanship with credibility and warmth.
    
    Layout:
    
    3 cards per row (desktop) × 2 rows, stacking to 1 per row on mobile.
    
    Subtle cream background (#FAF8F3) with generous spacing.
    
    Each card has:
    
    Soft white background
    
    Rounded corners (16 px radius)
    
    Thin olive or gold left border/accent
    
    Slight shadow for depth
    
    Top emoji/icon (representing topic)
    
    Bold olive-green headline
    
    Descriptive paragraph in muted gray text
    
    A beige highlight box at bottom for “Result:” data point.
    
    Card Content Examples:
    
    ⏱️ Speed Matters More Than You Think
    “Most olive oils sit for 6-24 hours before pressing, allowing oxidation to begin. We crush within 3 hours of harvest—before the olives even 'know' they’ve been picked.”
    Result: Peroxide at 6 meq O₂/kg vs. typical 15–18
    
    🧪 True Cold Extraction
    “We maintain temperatures below 27 °C throughout the process. Many ‘cold-pressed’ oils heat to 35–40 °C—destroying delicate polyphenols and that peppery finish.”
    Result: PPP at 2.1 % (88 % fresher than benchmark)
    ✅ Triple-Verified by Independent Labs
    “Every lot tested by NABL-accredited labs. Not ‘trust us’—scan the QR code and see the actual Certificate of Analysis.”
    Result: Heavy metals conforming to FSSAI, PAH-4 < 2 µg/kg
    
    🧴Protected Until You Pour
    “Dark-tinted bottles, cool-chain storage, nitrogen flushing—every detail preserves what we spent months growing and minutes extracting.”
    Result: OSI 24.3 hours—stays fresher, longer
    No Blending, No Bulk
    “Single-origin from our Australian groves. Not blended with cheaper imports or refined. Pure fruit expression—nothing hidden, nothing fixed.”
    Result: ΔK < 0.01 (no refinement detected)
    The Fat That Loves You Back
    “68.5 % monounsaturated fat (MUFA)—the heart-healthy fat backed by decades of research. Low saturated fat. This isn’t oil; it’s liquid nutrition.”
    Result: DAGs at at 71.5 %
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-info-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-info-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-info-grid-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-info-grid-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-info-grid-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-info-grid-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_color }};
    border-left: {{ block.settings.accent_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.accent_border_color }};
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_y | plus: 4 }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_blur | plus: 8 }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_color }};
  }

  .ai-info-card-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_spacing }}px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-info-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.headline_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-info-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.description_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-info-card-result-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.result_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.result_padding }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.result_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.result_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.result_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-info-card-result-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 700;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-info-grid-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-info-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-info-grid-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-info-grid-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-info-grid-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-info-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-info-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size | times: 0.95 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-info-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
